  "description": "The DinkToPdf API (IConverter, SynchronizedConverter, HtmlToPdfDocument, GlobalSettings, ObjectSettings) on the licensed SelectPdf.Universal library: Chromium rendering with no page limit, instead of wkhtmltopdf. The same code as the free SelectPdf.Compat.DinkToPdf package, for applications with a SelectPdf license. Windows, Linux x64/ARM64, macOS on Apple Silicon, Docker; no libwkhtmltox files. Not affiliated with DinkToPdf.",
